WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:13.879
Daisy: I like your hair, Jenna.

2
00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:17.803
Jenna: Thanks. My mom did it.

3
00:00:17.804 --> 00:00:20.821
Maya: It looks pretty.

4
00:00:20.822 --> 00:00:24.345
Jenna: It looks ridiculous.

5
00:00:24.346 --> 00:00:28.028
Jenna: But at least the flowers are purple.

6
00:00:28.029 --> 00:00:29.987
Mark: Look at my hair.

7
00:00:29.988 --> 00:00:33.772
I'm a monster!

8
00:00:33.773 --> 00:00:37.931
Coby: Mine is red, white, and blue!

9
00:00:37.932 --> 00:00:44.459
Daisy: I have eyes in the back of my head!

10
00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:47.322
Jenna: Those eyes look funny, Daisy.

11
00:00:47.323 --> 00:00:49.820
Everybody looks funny.

12
00:00:49.821 --> 00:00:54.115
Daisy: So now do you like Silly Hair Day?

13
00:00:54.116 --> 00:01:00.676
Jenna: Nope. I like pretty hair, not silly hair.

14
00:01:00.677 --> 00:01:06.768
Coby: Ha-ha! Here comes Miss Gray!

15
00:01:06.769 --> 00:01:12.549
Mark: Wow! Your hair looks so cool, Miss Gray.

16
00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:14.214
Miss Gray: Thank you, Mark.

17
00:01:14.215 --> 00:01:18.109
Miss Gray: Since we've been learning about rainbows . . .

18
00:01:18.110 --> 00:01:21.354
Daisy: You put all the colors in your hair!

19
00:01:21.355 --> 00:01:30.001
Kara: I see red, orange, yellow, green . . .

20
00:01:30.002 --> 00:01:31.849
Mark: Hi, Mrs. Ling!

21
00:01:31.850 --> 00:01:33.696
Look at our hair!

22
00:01:33.697 --> 00:01:37.323
Daisy: It's Silly Hair Day in Room Two!

23
00:01:37.324 --> 00:01:40.920
Maya: I made mine yellow like Sweetie's!

24
00:01:40.921 --> 00:01:43.333
Mrs. Ling: Oh. Hi, boys and girls . . .

25
00:01:43.334 --> 00:01:46.077
You look very nice today.

26
00:01:46.078 --> 00:01:48.626
Daisy: Nice? We don't look nice.

27
00:01:48.627 --> 00:01:50.664
We look silly.

28
00:01:50.665 --> 00:01:53.737
Mark: What is she doing?

29
00:01:53.738 --> 00:01:55.435
Jenna: She looks upset.

30
00:01:55.436 --> 00:01:57.262
I think something's wrong.

31
00:01:57.263 --> 00:01:58.979
Daisy: You're right, Jenna.

32
00:01:58.980 --> 00:02:01.551
Mrs. Ling? Are you okay?

33
00:02:01.552 --> 00:02:03.592
Mrs. Ling: No. I'm not okay.

34
00:02:03.593 --> 00:02:06.413
Something terrible has happened.

35
00:02:06.414 --> 00:02:09.146
Miss Gray: Oh no. What's wrong, Mrs. Ling?

36
00:02:09.147 --> 00:02:18.118
Mrs. Ling: I forgot to lock Sweetie's cage last night.

37
00:02:18.119 --> 00:02:21.176
Mrs. Ling: And now he's gone!
